  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tod man pla serves 4 as a snack and takes about 35 minutes plus chilling. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "White fish fillet",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "white-fish-fillet"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is blended to a smooth paste with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fish sauce",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fish-sauce"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "cornflour",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "cornflour"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", then folded with finely shredded "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "kaffir lime leaves",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kaffir-lime-leaves"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Chilling the paste makes shaping much easier. The cakes are shallow-fried until golden."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blend the fish until it is completely smooth and paste-like. A chunky mix will not bind properly and the cakes will fall apart."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
